  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44245864",
      "title": "Adding Validation Checks",
      "sourceHash": "3cd40cfcc6c0e57e2dac4f1e96501a064079429e7cda3d09c457060113ae9a48",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 5.52,
          "en": "So now that we got this form action set up,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.52,
          "end": 9.78,
          "en": "let's extract more values from the submitted form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9.78,
          "end": 13.2,
          "en": "And for that, I'll first of all rename this to just email",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 13.2,
          "end": 15.81,
          "en": "so that it's a bit shorter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.81,
          "end": 18.63,
          "en": "and then I'll extract all those other values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.63,
          "end": 21.63,
          "en": "For example, the password by using formData.get('password').",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.85,
          "end": 26.52,
          "en": "And as mentioned, these values here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.52,
          "end": 30.12,
          "en": "which we pass to the get method must be the values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.12,
          "end": 33.153,
          "en": "that were set up as names for these inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.56,
          "end": 36.81,
          "en": "So the password is one of them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.81,
          "end": 38.13,
          "en": "then I also want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.13,
          "end": 42.99,
          "en": "to get the confirmPassword value with formData.get,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.99,
          "end": 47.88,
          "en": "and then the name here is confirm-password.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.88,
          "end": 50.103,
          "en": "So I'll extract that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.06,
          "end": 55.887,
          "en": "And then get the firstName with formData.get('first-name').",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 57.27,
          "end": 59.853,
          "en": "That's the name that's set for this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 61.05,
          "end": 65.247,
          "en": "Then the lastName with formData.get('last-name'),",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 69.36,
          "end": 72.717,
          "en": "and then the role with formData.get('role').",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 75.63,
          "end": 78.657,
          "en": "Then also the terms with formData.get('terms').",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 81.39,
          "end": 85.53,
          "en": "And then last but not least, the acquisition channel,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 85.53,
          "end": 87.36,
          "en": "which is in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 87.36,
          "end": 89.52,
          "en": "this collection of inputs down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 89.52,
          "end": 93.66,
          "en": "where all inputs have the same name, acquisition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 93.66,
          "end": 95.58,
          "en": "but where the user can then check one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 95.58,
          "end": 98.03999999999999,
          "en": "or more of these inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 98.03999999999999,
          "end": 101.25,
          "en": "to select one or more channels they came from.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 101.25,
          "end": 104.88,
          "en": "And we can extract that value or those values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 104.88,
          "end": 107.31,
          "en": "since it can be multiple values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 107.31,
          "end": 112.31,
          "en": "and store them in a constant called acquisitionChannel",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 112.462,
          "end": 114.212,
          "en": "with formData.getAll,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 115.65,
          "end": 119.43,
          "en": "and then the name of those inputs, acquisition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 119.43,
          "end": 123.3,
          "en": "GetAll simply makes sure that if multiple boxes are checked,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 123.3,
          "end": 125.88,
          "en": "we get back an array of values here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 125.88,
          "end": 127.923,
          "en": "instead of just one value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 128.76,
          "end": 132.27,
          "en": "And these are then the values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 132.27,
          "end": 135.99,
          "en": "that can be extracted from that form, from that formData,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 135.99,
          "end": 139.56,
          "en": "which we get automatically from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 139.56,
          "end": 140.79,
          "en": "And now of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 140.79,
          "end": 144.88,
          "en": "you can use these values and validate them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 145.92000000000002,
          "end": 149.49,
          "en": "because of course, the user may submit this form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 149.49,
          "end": 154.49,
          "en": "in an invalid state if nothing's been entered, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 154.62,
          "end": 158.76,
          "en": "And in that case I want to show an error to the user just",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 158.76,
          "end": 161.07,
          "en": "as we also did it earlier in the course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 161.07,
          "end": 163.263,
          "en": "in an earlier course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 164.34,
          "end": 166.29,
          "en": "Now there are of course different ways",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 166.29,
          "end": 169.05,
          "en": "of implementing validation here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 169.05,
          "end": 174.05,
          "en": "Here, I'll add an errors array, which is empty initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 174.18,
          "end": 176.43,
          "en": "And then I'll add a couple of if checks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 176.43,
          "end": 181.43,
          "en": "to check for the validity of different fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 182.1,
          "end": 185.94,
          "en": "And for that, I prepared a validation.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 185.94,
          "end": 187.62,
          "en": "in the util folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 187.62,
          "end": 191.13,
          "en": "which contains some helper functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 191.13,
          "end": 194.25,
          "en": "we can use for validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 194.25,
          "end": 197.7,
          "en": "And therefore in this Signup.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 197.7,
          "end": 202.68,
          "en": "I'll import something from that validation file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 202.68,
          "end": 204.84,
          "en": "So by going up one level here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 204.84,
          "end": 208.23,
          "en": "and by then targeting this validation file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 208.23,
          "end": 212.103,
          "en": "and I then want to import isEmail here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 212.948,
          "end": 217.948,
          "en": "isNotEmpty, isEqualToOtherValue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 219.69,
          "end": 222.03,
          "en": "and hasMinLength.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 222.03,
          "end": 223.74,
          "en": "These four functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 223.74,
          "end": 226.083,
          "en": "because I'll use these four functions here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 227.25,
          "end": 229.26,
          "en": "starting with isEmail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 229.26,
          "end": 231.21,
          "en": "And I want to check if the value stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 231.21,
          "end": 233.82,
          "en": "in that email constant is a email address,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 233.82,
          "end": 235.2,
          "en": "or to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 235.2,
          "end": 236.67000000000002,
          "en": "I wanna check the opposite",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 236.67000000000002,
          "end": 238.63,
          "en": "by adding this exclamation mark here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 239.67000000000002,
          "end": 242.34,
          "en": "so that I check if it's not an email address.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 242.34,
          "end": 245.55,
          "en": "And in that case, if we make it into this if check,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 245.55,
          "end": 250.55,
          "en": "I wanna push a new error message into this errors array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 250.56,
          "end": 254.703,
          "en": "and that would be the, \"Invalid email address,\" message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 255.63,
          "end": 258.21,
          "en": "Now the next check then could be that we check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 258.21,
          "end": 262.38,
          "en": "if the password field maybe is empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 262.38,
          "end": 265.5,
          "en": "So if it's not not empty,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 265.5,
          "end": 268.17,
          "en": "since I only have a isNotEmpty function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 268.17,
          "end": 270.42,
          "en": "I'm checking for the opposite here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 270.42,
          "end": 273.09000000000003,
          "en": "and I'm checking if the password is not not empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 273.09000000000003,
          "end": 275.46,
          "en": "So if it is empty,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 275.46,
          "end": 279.213,
          "en": "or if it doesn't have a min length,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 280.17,
          "end": 282.633,
          "en": "the password of six characters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 284.01,
          "end": 285.99,
          "en": "If one of these two conditions is met,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 285.99,
          "end": 289.62,
          "en": "I also wanna push an error message here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 289.62,
          "end": 293.437,
          "en": "to this errors array, and that would be,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 293.437,
          "end": 296.88,
          "en": "\"You must provide a password",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 296.88,
          "end": 300.21,
          "en": "with at least six characters,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 300.21,
          "end": 301.713,
          "en": "or something like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 303.87,
          "end": 306.75,
          "en": "Then I want to check if my passwords are equal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 306.75,
          "end": 309.963,
          "en": "So the enter password and the confirmation password.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 310.92,
          "end": 314.787,
          "en": "And for that, we can use the isEqualToOtherValue function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 315.925,
          "end": 318.125,
          "en": "and check for the opposite here as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 318.125,
          "end": 322.95799999999997,
          "en": "and check if the password is not equal to confirmPassword.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 324.136,
          "end": 326.16,
          "en": "And in that case here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 326.16,
          "end": 330.63,
          "en": "I'll push, \"Passwords do not match,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 330.63,
          "end": 331.653,
          "en": "into this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 333.65999999999997,
          "end": 336.57,
          "en": "Well, and then we can also validate the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 336.57,
          "end": 338.69,
          "en": "and check if isNotEmpty,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 340.74,
          "end": 343.29,
          "en": "or check for the opposite to be precise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 343.29,
          "end": 346.71,
          "en": "if it is empty for the firstName,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 346.71,
          "end": 350.013,
          "en": "or if the lastName is empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 352.05,
          "end": 354.33,
          "en": "And if either of these two names is empty,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 354.33,
          "end": 356.79,
          "en": "I also want to push another error message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 356.79,
          "end": 358.68,
          "en": "into this array here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 358.68,
          "end": 361.747,
          "en": "and that error message now is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 361.747,
          "end": 364.83,
          "en": "\"Please provide both your first",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 364.83,
          "end": 367.857,
          "en": "and last name.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 369.48,
          "end": 374.253,
          "en": "And then I also wanna check if the role is maybe empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 375.66,
          "end": 378.69,
          "en": "So the role that was selected in that form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 378.69,
          "end": 379.92,
          "en": "And if that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 379.92,
          "end": 383.10699999999997,
          "en": "I'll push this error message into this array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 383.10699999999997,
          "end": 385.407,
          "en": "\"Please select a role.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 386.28,
          "end": 388.02,
          "en": "Now I'm almost done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 388.02,
          "end": 390.9,
          "en": "I'll just add two additional checks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 390.9,
          "end": 395.9,
          "en": "and check if we don't have the terms check box clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 395.97,
          "end": 398.90999999999997,
          "en": "So if terms is falsey,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 398.90999999999997,
          "end": 402.243,
          "en": "and terms is simply the value I get from this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 403.267,
          "end": 407.253,
          "en": "\"I agree to the terms and conditions,\" checkbox down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 408.57,
          "end": 412.32,
          "en": "So if that is falsey, the user has not checked it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 412.32,
          "end": 414.487,
          "en": "And in that case, I'll push,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 414.487,
          "end": 416.85,
          "en": "\"You must agree",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 416.85,
          "end": 421.5,
          "en": "to the terms and conditions,\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 421.5,
          "end": 423.09,
          "en": "into this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 423.09,
          "end": 424.8,
          "en": "And then last but not least,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 424.8,
          "end": 426.573,
          "en": "I'll check if acquisitionChannel,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 427.41,
          "end": 430.14,
          "en": "this array has a length of zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 430.14,
          "end": 431.91,
          "en": "which means the user didn't select",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 431.91,
          "end": 435.48,
          "en": "a single acquisition channel.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 435.48,
          "end": 438.66700000000003,
          "en": "And in that case, I also wanna show an error and say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 438.66700000000003,
          "end": 443.66700000000003,
          "en": "\"Please select at least one acquisition channel,\" like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 446.22,
          "end": 449.49,
          "en": "So that's lots of validation logic here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 449.49,
          "end": 454.29,
          "en": "lots of steps to validate this input, but with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 454.29,
          "end": 458.4,
          "en": "we're now really using these submitted values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 458.4,
          "end": 460.08,
          "en": "And the next step now of course is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 460.08,
          "end": 462.84000000000003,
          "en": "to show these error messages to the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
